        "content": "## ② Preparación local · staging + diff\nTrunca `staging_tryton_assets` → carga masiva `jsonb_to_recordset($1)` (`DISTINCT ON tryton_asset_id`, `ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING`) → diff `staging ⨝ model_map ⨝ status_map ⟕ asset_map` (`action ∈ {create,update}`) → `¿Cambios?`/`Sin cambios(→Continuar)`.\n**Contrato:** `action` notEmpty; `stage.payload` es `JSON.stringify(rows)` de `payload/total`."
