        "color": 3,
        "width": 1024,
        "height": 176,
        "content": "## ③ Sincronización por lote (1×1) y self-heal\n`Batch changes` (splitInBatches, *batchSize 1* secuencial para no disparar 429 `api-throttle:api` 60/min) → `¿Crear o actualizar?` → `POST/PATCH /hardware` (`batch 1/1200ms`, `retry 4×3s`, `fullResponse`, `continueRegularOutput`) → `Saved?` → `Upsert asset map` / `Find→Recover→Recovered asset?→Upsert/Log`. *Self-heal:* `GET ?asset_tag=X` re-mapea huérfanos tras cancelación a mitad de loop.\n**Contrato:** `body.status == 'success'` ; `body.payload.id/asset_tag/name`."
